1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,532
India is the destination of the year for 2027. Know the five things you must never do.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:11,367
Don't bring a vape. E-cigarettes are banned in India, so you can't buy them or bring them in.

3
00:00:12,186 --> 00:00:17,353
Don't take photos of airports, dams or military sites. They are off limits.

4
00:00:18,173 --> 00:00:22,341
Don't carry rupees in or out of the country. Visitors aren't allowed to.

5
00:00:23,161 --> 00:00:29,124
Don't eat beef. Several states ban it, and vigilantes have attacked people suspected of handling it.

6
00:00:29,944 --> 00:00:36,626
And don't carry a satellite phone or a handheld GPS without a licence. Even in transit, you can be arrested.

